      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can concur with a similiar problem, when I enter VRChat and then open up SteamVR menu to set some settings, my framerate drops to a locked 11FPS and gets progressively worse when trying to fix it, at the moment my only solution is fully restarting VR I run AMD chips as well (AMD Ryzen 7 2700X, 16 Gb RAM, GeForce 2070 Super)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
