  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-04T05:34:20.013Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of the Unity 2019.4.30f1 update, VRChat has had an issue where it would occasionally begin to consume a large amount of VRAM and crash when played via Steam Play in SteamVR mode. This happens even at the login screen; and makes the game unplayable as it crashes every few minutes.\nWith 2019.4.31f1; it seems that this issue has gotten worse and happens more consistently. Prior, the game would sometimes to often function correctly.\nDesktop mode is unaffected.",
